WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
Bombshell!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
The Truth About BanchouLeomon

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.260
Bombshell!

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.500
The Truth About BanchouLeomon!

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.470
I... have always been troubled.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.810
I incessantly pondered over whether Yggdrasil's way of justice was true or not.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:25.980
But...

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:31.510
You must have wanted to tell me such thoughts were wrong,

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.860
Daimon Suguru.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.900
Daimon Suguru?

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.350
Your daughter should be able to tell...

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.810
by looking at this man who loved the Digital World

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.300
and wished for peace between the Digimon and humans more than anyone else...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.940
The soul of this passionate man!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.570
What are you doing?!

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:06.640
Craniummon!

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.020
You... Why?!

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.570
I wanted to try believing once more...

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.990
in the infinite possibilities that humans and Digimon can create together!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.560
Hurry!

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.120
To Yggdrasil!

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.660
Craniummon!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.910
BanchouLeomon is...

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.390
my dad?!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.270
What...

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.440
What inconceivable news!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.000
Don't give me that crap!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.860
Who the hell will believe that?!

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.720
When you were a little boy,

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.890
you fell off the monkey bars and hit your head.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.890
{onkei: There are so many jokes I can make out of this if I was mean enough. D8} {Splash: WE LOVE YOU OSARU}

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:46.030
How do you know...?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.250
Have you forgotten?

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:53.670
I was the one who carried you all the way to the hospital.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.900
It's all right!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.450
It's not a deep cut!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.930
If you're a man, then bear with it!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.370
You're lying...

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.250
That can't...

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.270
A BANCHOU NEVER LIES!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:19.530
Am I wrong, Masaru?

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.820
Masaru!

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.220
BanchouLeomon?!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.540
You're alive?!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.330
I won't die that easily.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:37.000
That's because this body has two lives dwelling within it.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.250
Two lives...?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:47.550
NOTE: BanchouLeomon calls himself "ore" (superior male "I"), while Suguru calls himself "watashi" (polite male "I") while they're telling their story.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.290
After separating from Mercurimon,

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:47.550
I wandered around in search of Yggdrasil.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:56.300
Along the way, we came across each other as though we were destined to meet.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:03.400
You've got guts stepping into my territory without notice.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:06.120
I apologize for my rudeness.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:12.110
But I have an important mission to meet Yggdrasil, the God of the Digital World!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.080
What?

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.070
I'm in a hurry.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.290
Let me pass.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.590
A banchou or a god...

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.130
Who is greater?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:21.590
What?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.940
A battle between men has no need for a reason.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:30.780
We simply fire up our fighting spirits as we mutually display our fierce pride.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.840
Well fought...

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.580
You threw some pretty good punches yourself...

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.080
What's your name?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.900
Daimon Suguru.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:01.500
And you?

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.640
I'm a banchou.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.200
BanchouLeomon.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.280
A banchou, huh?

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.260
No wonder you're so strong.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:18.230
And that's how we completely hit it off with each other.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.570
Wait a second!

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.000
What does that have to do with...?

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.340
MASARU!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.730
LISTEN UNTIL SOMEONE FINISHES TALKING!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:34.980
We continued traveling together in search of Yggdrasil.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:40.670
But because we didn't even know if this god truly existed, it was like trying to catch clouds.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:46.210
A long time passed, with utterly no clues to lead us.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:52.390
And then, one day...

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.850
Are you the ones searching for Yggdrasil?

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.650
Who are you?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.490
I am the most faithful of the Royal Knights who serve under Yggdrasil,

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:06.860
Craniummon!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.070
The Royal... Knights?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.800
What's so funny?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.620
It's not because we're mocking you.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.520
We're happy!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:29.870
We've finally come upon evidence that Yggdrasil isn't a myth, but that he truly exists!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.540
What?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.680
Please!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.640
Take us to Yggdrasil!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.690
Absurd!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:43.110
You believe Yggdrasil will allow an audience with a lowly human like you?!

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.590
Don't sneer at the humans!

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.360
What?

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:52.070
Humans have the power of emotions within them which we Digimon do not have!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.530
The power of emotions?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.230
Yes!

00:06:56.230 --> 00:07:02.170
When a Digimon becomes united with a human's emotions, unlimited potential can be born!

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.340
Then show me...

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.340
this limitless potential you speak of!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.280
Charge!

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:20.170
Digisoul Burst!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:26.820
Wh-What?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.060
BanchouLeomon!

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.670
Burst Mode!

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.000
You...!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.700
Burning Banchou Punch!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.690
Is this...

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.040
the power of humans?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.150
What's that?

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.560
Why is the earth shaking?

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.350
That was splendid, human.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:57.470
It's inside my head...

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.930
There's a voice echoing through my mind!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:04.340
I never imagined that human emotions could boost the power of Digimon to such an extent.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.290
This has far surpassed my expectations.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.350
This is...

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.360
My God!

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:15.360
This is the first time Yggdrasil has presented himself publicly!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.460
This is...

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.830
The God of the Digital World...

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.130
Yggdrasil!

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:27.140
At last, we met Yggdrasil.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:31.640
The bright future to be shared between humans and Digimon should have been realized then.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.120
But...!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.520
A disaster occurred at the worst timing!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:48.830
Yggdrasil has commanded us to wreak vengeance against the human world.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.610
Please!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.940
Stop your attack!

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.910
Humans and Digimon can appreciate one another!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.480
They can cultivate friendships!

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.700
But...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.740
the sins that the humans have inflicted on us are too great.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:09.880
The hatred and sorrow we Digimon have for them now will never vanish!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:14.190
Answering hatred with hatred only creates more hatred.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.380
Why can't you realize that?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.230
What?

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.390
BanchouLeomon!

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:22.240
If we don't break the chain of hatred at some point,

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.560
there will be no future for both humans and Digimon!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.520
Then...

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:30.770
That means we Digimon are the only ones who must endure the anguish!

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:36.780
Can you dare to repeat those words to the ones who have lost their beloved companions forever?!

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.560
Please!

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.110
Have faith in humanity just one more time!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:45.060
I promise that this tragedy will never happen again!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.000
I bet my life on it!

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:51.270
Your life?

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.670
Believe him.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.330
BanchouLeomon!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.630
This man will never lie.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:58.150
But...

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.860
Yggdrasil!

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:06.990
I shall trust your word.

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:11.830
Acknowledging the risk that Suguru put on his life, Yggdrasil accepted his plea.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.040
But...

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.390
It's showtime!

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:26.730
What?

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.120
Mercurimon is...?!

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.400
He's been killed.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.510
Damn it!

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:34.840
What are Chief Yushima and Satsuma-kun doing?!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:40.140
I've heard another disturbing rumor.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:44.550
Your son, Daimon Masaru, is here in the Digital World.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.310
What?

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:49.830
It appears he came chasing after a man named Kurata,

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.760
but he is utterly powerless against him.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.170
Let me out of here right now!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.040
You can't leave!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.220
BanchouLeomon!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:03.590
You made a promise with Yggdrasil,

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.280
placing your life on that vow.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:11.080
It's true that I was the one, at that time, who put in a good word for you to Yggdrasil.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.050
But...

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:15.260
A man must keep his promises!

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:20.470
A man doesn't... go back on his word...

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:25.130
Masaru...

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.250
Masaru!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:31.120
Masaru!!!

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:41.150
We shall now commence Daimon Suguru's execution.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:44.660
Do you have any last words?

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.200
I don't want to die.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.030
What?!

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.920
I want to make Masaru...

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.120
I want to make my son into a fine young man,

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.160
so I can't die until then.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.000
You dare to make those words your last at your dying hour?

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.210
If you're a man, then don't make such unsightly utterances!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.370
Do it!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.450
Cease that execution!

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.630
BanchouLeomon!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.470
You...!

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:15.440
Does this mean you are betraying the Digimon and siding with the humans?!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:22.170
I would merely like to, as his friend, send him personally to the other world.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.470
BanchouLeomon!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.060
Forgive me.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.710
Listen, Yggdrasil!

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:45.680
This man believed in the future of humans and Digimon, and gave us his life!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:51.640
In honor of this man's passion, desist from your attack on the human world!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.950
Forgive me, Suguru.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:10.030
This was the only thing I could do to save you.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.870
Banchou... Leomon...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.280
Suguru.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.330
Entrust your life to me.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.730
My... life...?

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.290
Become one with me.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:24.380
That's the only way to fool Yggdrasil's eyes.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:31.100
By uniting with me, you can also watch over your son, Masaru, in the shadows.

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:33.570
Okay...

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.270
I trust my life... with you.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.970
Then...

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:45.740
You're really...

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.370
You're really my dad?!

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:52.050
You've sure grown big, Masaru.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.410
Why?!

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:02.580
Why did you keep quiet about such an important thing from me until now?!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.130
Dad!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.420
Even if I wanted to tell you, I couldn't.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:11.520
Yggdrasil always kept us under watch.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.350
Now you are inside of me.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.000
Let's hurry.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.530
We have to stop Kurata.

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:20.210
Yeah.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.900
I won't let that happen.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.600
Yggdrasil!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:32.700
You are both fools for thinking you could deceive a god.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:38.160
I have now taken this body hostage.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.370
What?!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.510
If you ever tell anyone about your true identities,

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:47.320
or directly involve yourselves in battle,

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.340
I shall destroy this body at once.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.380
Why...

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:03.030
Why would Yggdrasil do that?

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.570
It's a trial from God.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:08.630
Yggdrasil wanted to test them!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:14.570
It was all to determine whether or not we humans were a positive existence to the Digimon!

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.710
That's too selfish of him!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.520
That's right!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:22.470
Does that mean he doesn't care if masses of humans and Digimon get hurt in the process?!

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.920
Exactly.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:34.930
Yggdrasil!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:34.930
Yggdrasil!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.270
You worthless humans...

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.200
Even when you are confronted with this unprecedented crisis,

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:43.770
not once have you reflected upon the error of your ways.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:46.400
All you do is run around fretfully.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.760
Your actions are truly the height of stupidity.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.120
That's not true!

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:51.570
He's right!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:57.030
There are plenty of people who are working hard to protect the worlds from this disaster!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.080
What can the likes of humans do?

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:06.500
Ikuto!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:08.710
Humans are unnecessary.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:15.470
That is what I, Yggdrasil, the God of the Digital World, have concluded!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.430
Like hell we'd accept that self-centered decision of yours!

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:21.040
He's right!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.890
You can't get away with everything just because you're a god!

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.400
Silence!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.210
All who defy me deserve to die!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.750
You don't know anything!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.160
What?

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:48.350
I have fun being with Aniki!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:52.690
I like fighting strong guys and getting stronger myself!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.480
It's exciting!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:54.840
Agumon...

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.380
Me, too!

00:16:57.380 --> 00:17:00.300
I am proud to be fighting alongside my master!

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:01.630
Gaomon...

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.010
Me, too!

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.010
{onkei: I am so tempted to write "Me, three!" here and Falcomon with "Me, four!" except it would totally kill the mood.} {Splash: XD}

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.810
I love Yoshino!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.220
Lalamon...

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:07.540
Me, too!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.690
Ikuto is precious to me!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:10.850
Falcomon...

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:15.070
Digimon and humans can appreciate each other!

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.030
Don't be stupid!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.840
What should we do?

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:26.890
What should we do to stop Yggdrasil?

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:27.670
Dad!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:34.720
There will come a time in a man's life when he must accomplish something at the risk of his life.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.380
Now is that time.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:38.360
Dad?

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.370
Masaru!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:42.010
Take care of Mom and Chika.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.170
Dad...!

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:03.810
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:03.810
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:08.770
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:08.770
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.880
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.880
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:14.500
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:14.500
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.380
You're coming with me to the bottom of Hell.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:14.690
Wha...?!

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:19.310
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:19.310
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.120
Now, Masaru!

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:19.090
Destroy my body along with Yggdrasil!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:21.830
No way!

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.270
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.270
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.170
I can't do that!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:23.700
Do it!

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:26.560
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:26.560
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.650
You're a man!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:31.830
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:31.830
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:27.430
But...!

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:37.630
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:37.630
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.210
Please.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.300
Masaru!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.300
NOW!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.260
Dad...

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:43.800
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:43.800
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.580
Masaru!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.190
Masaru!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.560
Digisoul Charge...

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.640
Overdrive!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:58.710
Agumon, evolve!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.360
ShineGreymon!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.260
Let go of me!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.890
You'll die, too, if you stay like this!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.640
When we revealed to them who we really were...

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.660
We were already prepared for death!

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:34.150
Now, shoot!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.130
Masaru!

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:49.060
Dad...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.480
Dad...!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:00.790
DAD!!!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.530
Thank you...

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.590
Masaru...

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:13.700
DAD!!!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.660
Dad...

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.010
This surge of energy...

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:25.110
Could Yggdrasil have...?!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.640
Did you feel that?

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:30.960
Yes.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:34.150
Yggdrasil has fallen.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:36.180
Now you understand.

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.050
God is not absolute.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:40.830
Yes...

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:45.820
But... it appears I've realized that too late.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:55.460
We defeated Yggdrasil...

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:58.630
Dad...

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:00.760
Let's go home...

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.210
To the human world...

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.220
Not everything is over yet.

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:08.640
Yeah.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.040
Let's go, ShineGre-...!

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:11.680
What's that?!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.940
Foolish humans.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:21.750
Your punishment for disobeying me

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.150
shall now be enforced!

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.050
I...

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:30.160
am God!

